[patient] Sure. I've been eating more sweets during the holidays, and this past week, I felt really lightheaded, saw spots in my vision, and was very dizzy. I went to the emergency room, and they told me my blood sugar was high. They gave me IV fluids and told me to get back into a routine and watch my diet.

