[patient] Okay, I understand.

[doctor] Regarding your atrial fibrillation, it's asymptomatic and well-controlled at this time. Continue taking metoprolol 25 mg twice daily, and I'll refill your prescription today.

[patient] Got it.

[doctor] For your reflux, it seems well-controlled on your current regimen. Continue taking Protonix 40 mg daily.

[patient] Okay, I will.

[doctor] Do you have any questions or concerns about the plan?

[patient] No, I think I understand everything. Thank you.

[doctor] Great. If you have any issues or further questions, don't hesitate to contact us. We'll see you back in two weeks to monitor your progress.

[patient] Thank you, doctor.

